# The Blazor client's generated launch profile. Deliberately NOT shipped: it starts the client on
# its own DevServer with no Northwind.Server behind it, so every query fails. The sample is run
# from the server, which hosts these files (samples/README.md). The server's own profile IS
# tracked, because it pins the port both halves agree on.
